<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="correction" xml:lang="EN"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Emerg Infect Dis</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">EID</journal-id><journal-title>Emerging Infectious Diseases</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">1080-6040</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1080-6059</issn><publisher><publisher-name>Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2687034</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">999000</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3201/eid1505.999000</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Erratum</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Erratum&#x02014;Vol. 15, No. 3</article-title><alt-title alt-title-type="running-head">Erratum</alt-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>5</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><volume>15</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage seq="b">853</fpage><lpage>853</lpage><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="15" page="452" id="N0x3d41f80N0x3bd7320" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="19239762" ext-link-type="pubmed"><article-title>Methicillin-Resistant Staphylococcus aureus in Poultry</article-title></related-article></article-meta></front><body><p>A reference was missing from the article Methicillin-Resistant <italic>Staphylococcus aureus</italic> in Poultry (D. Persoons et al.). In the Table accompanying the article, the data on <italic>spa</italic> types isolated from pigs were originally described in de Neeling AJ, van den Broek MJM, Spalburg EC, van Santen-Verheuvel MG, Dam-Deisz WDC, Boshuizen HC, et al. High prevalence of methicillin-resistant <italic>Staphylococcus aureus</italic> in pigs. Vet Microbiol. 2007;122:366&#x02013;72. The article has been corrected online (<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/EID/content/15/3/452.htm">www.cdc.gov/EID/content/15/3/452.htm</ext-link>).</p></body></article>